set security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match source-address any
set security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match application any
set security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit then permit

delete security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match source-address any
delete security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match destination-address any
delete security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match application any
delete security policies from-zone ISP1-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit then permit
delete security policies from-zone ISP2-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match source-address any
delete security policies from-zone ISP2-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match destination-address any
delete security policies from-zone ISP2-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit match application any
delete security policies from-zone ISP2-untrust to-zone trust policy default-permit then permit

set protocols ospf traceoptions file ospf-log
set protocols ospf traceoptions flag hello
set protocols ospf traceoptions flag state
set protocols ospf traceoptions flag packets
set protocols ospf traceoptions flag error

#Real-time follow: 
monitor start ospf-log (Press Ctrl+C to stop)
